    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# ⚠️ Deletion Policy Notice\n❌ Google Drive files are NEVER deleted by this workflow\nThis automation does not delete or modify any files in Google Drive.\nGoogle Drive is treated as an external content source and remains completely untouched.\n\n🧠 Source of Truth\nThe central record in this system is:\n\n✅ Gemini File Search Documents\nAll deletion and synchronization logic is based solely on what exists inside the Gemini File Search Store.\n\n\n📌 Role of Data Table\nThe Data Table is used only to:\n✅ Store the Google Drive File ID\n✅ Track the Gemini File Search Document name\n✅ Assist in cleanup and reconciliation operations\n\nIt is not the source of truth.\n🗑 What This Workflow Can Delete\n\nThis workflow may delete:\n✅ Documents inside the Gemini File Search Store\n✅ Corresponding tracking records in the Data Table\n\nThis workflow will never delete:\n❌ Files from Google Drive\n❌ Folders from Google Drive\n❌ Any Google Drive content directly\n\n🔒 System Design Principle\nGoogle Drive = External content source\nGemini File Search = Indexed knowledge base (central record)\nData Table = Tracking reference layer\n\nAll cleanup operations affect only the indexed knowledge base, never the original Google Drive files.",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 816
      },
